        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions PR-MDS03022, Back-to-Back Pair of Large Pineapple Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEchoing the beautiful styling known best in Palm Springs, the Large Pineapple Door Handles are a great way to add a tropical, yet glamorous addition to your home or office. The Large Pineapple Back-to-Back Door Handle has a 22 inch length with a 10.5 inch center to center. It comes packaged as a back-to-back pair--pulls attach to each other through the door--including a pair of lock-down rosettes (not pictured).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with Back to Back mounting (2 door pulls bolted to each other - 1 door pull for each side of a door). Includes lock down threaded rosettes to securely tighten the door pulls to the door. Also available: Individual <a href=\"/products/large-pineapple-door-handle-first-impressions-mds3rddsbr\"><b>First Impressions Model MDS03</b></a> for one side of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Madison Series 3 Pull Pair:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 22\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-3/5\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pineapple-handle-details.jpg?v=1704354555\"><b>Detailed First Impressions MDS03 Picture</b></a></li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back to Back mounting. Custom Ordered Size. <b>No Returns. Please allow 8 - 16 weeks for delivery.</b></i>\r\n</p>",
